[I] High-performance distributed object storage

[T] RustFS is a high-performance distributed object storage software built with
[T] Rust, positioned as an alternative to MinIO.

[U] https://rustfs.com/

[A] The RustFS Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/filesystem
[F] CROSS NO-LTO
[R] - alpha arc avr32 blackfin cris hppa hppa64 i860 m68k microblaze nios2 openrisc superh

[L] APL
[V] 1.0.6

[D] 2e5dbfb2fa561aa975347b7b1a4f39289f12ff3a10ca547038a9beef rustfs-1.0.6.tar.gz https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/archive/1.0.6/

cargoinstopt=
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "*jitterentropy*?-O0"
atstage cross && hook_add postmake 5 "install -v target/${arch_target}/*/{rustfs-mcp,rustfs,gproto} $root$bindir"
atstage native && hook_add postmake 5 "install -v target/*/{rustfs-mcp,rustfs,gproto} $root$bindir"
